# The Python sidecars are checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# They are not only run — they are ASSERTED ON as text: `denoise.rs` pulls
# `python/denoise.py` in with `include_str!` and pins protocol invariants by
# matching literal source, e.g. `"_reclaim_stale_parts(dest)\n    for attempt in"`.
# With `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default, and this machine's setting) a
# fresh clone would rewrite those newlines to CRLF and every such assertion would
# fail on a tree that is byte-identical in git. Pinning eol here makes the working
# copy match what the test expects, on any platform.
*.py text eol=lf

# Shell scripts, for the plainest version of the same reason: a `.sh` checked
# out with CRLF does not run at all on the platform it exists for — every line
# ends in a stray carriage return and the interpreter reports a command it was
# never asked to run. `scripts/build_app_bundle.sh` is executed by the macOS
# release job, where that failure would surface as a broken release rather than
# as a diff.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The sidecar's data files are held to the same rule, and for a HARDER reason:
# `python/ade20k_class_table.json` is gated on its own sha256 at run time
# (`segment.py`'s `SKY_CLASS_TABLE_PIN`), so a checkout that rewrote its
# newlines would not fail a text assertion — it would fail the digest, on a tree
# git considers identical, and read as tampering. Autodetected `text` is not
# enough: with no attribute at all `core.autocrlf=true` converts on checkout.
python/*.json text eol=lf

# The Rust fixtures, for the first reason again: `src/fixtures/*.json` are
# pulled in with `include_str!` and compared BYTE FOR BYTE against what the
# serializer produces (`recipe::tests::the_default_recipe_serializes_byte_for_byte_as_its_fixture`).
# `serde_json` writes LF, so a checkout that rewrote the fixture to CRLF would
# fail that test on a tree git considers identical --- on any Windows clone with
# the default `core.autocrlf=true`, which is this machine's setting and every
# Windows contributor's.
src/fixtures/*.json text eol=lf
